ack"},{"key":"kTable_3","fr":"Jus","en":"Juice"},{"key":"cake","fr":"Gâteau","en":"Cake"},{"key":"bottles","fr":"Bouteilles de jus","en":"Bottles of juice"},{"key":"crepes","fr":"Crêpes","en":"Pancakes"},{"key":"compotes","fr":"Compotes","en":"Fruit pouches"},{"key":"snackH","fr":"L’en-cas avant le spectacle (19 h 15)","en":"The snack before the show (19:15)"},{"key":"snackHint","fr":"Ce qu’elles mangent avant de danser change leur énergie et leur concentration plus tard dans la soirée.","en":"What they eat before dancing changes their energy and focus later in the evening."},{"key":"snackFx_rien","fr":"rien dans le ventre","en":"nothing in their tummies"},{"key":"snackFx_bonbons","fr":"un coup de fouet… puis un gros coup de barre une heure après","en":"a sugar rush… then a crash an hour later"},{"key":"snackFx_fruits","fr":"cale un peu, donne un peu d’énergie","en":"fills them a bit, a bit of energy"},{"key":"snackFx_barres","fr":"cale bien, donne de l’énergie","en":"fills them well, gives energy"},{"key":"snackFx_tartines","fr":"cale très bien","en":"fills them very well"},{"key":"costH","fr":"Les costumes","en":"The costumes"},{"key":"costHint","fr":"Chaque danse a son costume. La classe se change entre ses deux danses.","en":"Each dance has its own costume. The class changes between its two dances."},{"key":"outfit","fr":"La tenue","en":"Outfit"},{"key":"colour","fr":"La couleur","en":"Colour"},{"key":"shoes","fr":"Les chaussures","en":"Shoes"},{"key":"acc","fr":"L’accessoire","en":"Accessory"},{"key":"hairH","fr":"Les coiffures (faites avant le spectacle)","en":"Hairdos (done before the show)"},{"key":"putOn","fr":"⏱ {0} min","en":"⏱ {0} min"},{"key":"suits","fr":"✨ va avec cette danse","en":"✨ suits this dance"},{"key":"pointesWarn","fr":"Seules les classes très expérimentées tiennent sur les pointes.","en":"Only very experienced classes can dance on pointe."},{"key":"buy","fr":"{0} ⭐","en":"{0} ⭐"},{"key":"notEnough","fr":"Pas assez d’étoiles : un beau gala en rapporte !","en":"Not enough stars: a great gala earns plenty!"},{"key":"bought","fr":"Acheté : {0} ✨","en":"Bought: {0} ✨"},{"key":"buildH","fr":"La loge","en":"The dressing room"},{"key":"buildHint","fr":"Choisis un meuble, puis touche le sol de la loge pour le poser. Touche un meuble posé pour le tourner, le déplacer ou le ranger.","en":"Pick a piece, then tap the dressing room floor to place it. Tap a placed piece to turn, move or put it away."},{"key":"goLoge","fr":"🚪 Aller dans la loge","en":"🚪 Go to the dressing room"},{"key":"schoolName","fr":"Le nom de l’école","en":"School name"},{"key":"fxH","fr":"Ce que fait ta loge","en":"What your dressing room does"},{"key":"rotate","fr":"↻ Tourner","en":"↻ Turn"},{"key":"rotateKey","fr":"↻ Tourner (touche R)","en":"↻ Turn (R key)"},{"key":"move","fr":"✥ Déplacer","en":"✥ Move"},{"key":"remove","fr":"Ranger","en":"Put away"},{"key":"cancel","fr":"Annuler","en":"Cancel"},{"key":"fx_postesNone","fr":"💇 Aucun miroir : une maman coiffe avec un miroir de poche (1 poste)","en":"💇 No mirror: a mum does hair with a pocket mirror (1 station)"},{"key":"fx_calm","fr":"😌 Calme : −{0} de trac","en":"😌 Calm: −{0} nerves"},{"key":"fx_water","fr":"💧 De l’eau pour garder la tête claire","en":"💧 Water keeps heads clear"},{"key":"fx_fruit","fr":"🍎 Des fruits contre la faim","en":"🍎 Fruit against hunger"},{"key":"fx_fan","fr":"🌀 Il fait moins chaud : moins de fatigue","en":"🌀 Cooler: less tiredness"},{"key":"fx_shoes","fr":"👟 Les chaussons sont rangés : on se rechausse plus vite","en":"👟 Shoes tidied away: quicker to change"},{"key":"fx_screen","fr":"🎎 Un paravent : on se change plus vite","en":"🎎 A changing screen: quicker to change"},{"key":"fx_sieste","fr":"😴 Les petits peuvent se reposer","en":"😴 The little ones can rest"},{"key":"fx_doudous","fr":"🧸 Les doudous rassurent les petits","en":"🧸 Cuddly toys comfort the little ones"},{"key":"fx_barre","fr":"🤸 On s’échauffe : moins de trac","en":"🤸 Warming up: fewer nerve

