## /Game/Toast (visual) — 6 nodes, 6 wires
  The little message at the bottom of the window ("Bought: Fairy ✨", "Not enough stars…", what just happened in the evening), shown for 2.6 seconds.
  visual (indent = child of the line above):
    to_root: Group "Toast" {position: "absolute", alignX: "center", alignY: "bottom", marginBottom: "var(--space-6)", sizeMode: "contentSize", maxWidth: {"value":520,"unit":"px"}, backgroundColor: "var(--surface)", borderStyle: "solid", borderWidth: "var(--border-1)", borderColor: "var(--primary)", borderRadius: "var(--radius-xl)", paddingLeft: "var(--space-4)", paddingRight: "var(--space-4)", paddingTop: "var(--space-2-5)", paddingBottom: "var(--space-2-5)", zIndex: 6, mounted: false}
      to_text: Text {fontWeight: "var(--font-bold)", textAlignX: "center"}
  logic:
    to_sub: net.noodl.GlobalStore.Subscribe {storeName: "ui", keys: "toast"}
